# //////////////////////////Relay////////////////#

### Create new relay (Chỉ trong nutnhan_1,nutnhan_2,nutnhan_3,nutnhan_4)
POST http://0.0.0.0:8000/api/relay/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email_user": "vinhnguyenkhac20@gmail.com",
    "relayName": "nutnhan2",
    "status": "OFF"
}


### Get relay
GET http://0.0.0.0:8000/api/relay/getStatus
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email_user": "vinhnguyenkhac20@gmail.com",
    "relayName": "nutnhan2"
}


### Get All Status relay
GET http://0.0.0.0:8000/api/relay/getAllStatus?email_user=vinhnguyenkhac20@gmail.com
Content-Type: application/json




### Get history relay data
GET http://0.0.0.0:8000/api/relay/getHistory
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "relayName": "nutnhan2"
}


### Update relay
POST http://0.0.0.0:8000/api/relay/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email_user": "vinhnguyenkhac20@gmail.com",
    "relayName": "nutnhan2",
    "status": "OFF"
}


### Delete relay
